== 1. a copy that fails midway, then rollback

$ mandrake link apply
  links: backupcopy  rules -> $T/does-not-exist
  Error: stopped at rules; `mandrake link rollback` undoes this run ($T/mh/state/journal/20261025-011256-001.json)
  
  Caused by:
      0: copy source $T/does-not-exist
      1: No such file or directory (os error 2)
  exit 1

$ mandrake link rollback
  rolled back 1 steps
  exit 0

$ ls ~/.claude/rules
  original.txt

$ find state/backups -type f

verdict: FIXED original.txt is back in ~/.claude/rules
